# Session handoff notes. Working documents, not validation infrastructure:
# they are rewritten wholesale each session and supersede one another, so
# tracking them puts churn in the history for no provenance gain. The TSV
# ledgers under references/applications/ remain tracked and are the source
# of truth. milestone_a_handoff.md and step2_handoff.md were tracked before
# this rule and are untracked from here on; their earlier revisions stay in
# history because they were already pushed.
Exec/.DevTests/**/*_handoff.md
